{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:19:57+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "12 Labours of Hercules XIV: Message in a Bottle", "steam_appid": 1912330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/657ca477e60be5700c2d29f4af74571a.avif?t=1789037046\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hercules and Megara peacefully sailed on the ship enjoying the sun and breeze when a strange glowing bottle appeared on the sea surface. Within it lay a message: a desperate call for help. Who could send it? And what happened to this person? In this fast-paced time management adventure, our heroic couple goes in search of answers immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/97a9e5cb8d9071095847a1b9e81bc79e.avif?t=1789037046\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon they found a sick, old man sitting on the beach. Hercules barely recognized him as Poseidon! Somebody stole the Sea Master's divine strength… But who is cunning enough to do this? And what else is he or she capable of?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/74e0ad5e0e1e2cd03f03cf9e14276cc3.avif?t=1789037046\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hercules has to sort things out, find the villain, save Olympian gods and the whole world… again! Join his fascinating marine investigation in &quot;12 Labours of Hercules XIV: Message in a Bottle&quot;! Yo-ho-ho!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/d121dae433ca7f13d56da6ad64227fca.avif?t=1789037046\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/64976a87fe6063c35a0698d79cdb2445.avif?t=1789037046\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany Hercules with a new Game Speed setting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sublevels, bonus levels, super bonus levels and extra super-bonus levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive guide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wallpapers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional bonus levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hercules saving gods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 unlockable Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/6fcece2b0a1bc00cb7c8c14d95b0af9e.avif?t=1789037046\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect For Fans Of</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time management games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greek mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystery/investigation stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing single-player games</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912330/extras/657ca477e60be5700c2d29f4af74571a.avif?t=1789037046\" width=614 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap